  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Place water, milk, egg, vanilla extract, bread flour, sucralose and brown sugar blend, salt, cinnamon, cocoa powder, yeast, and margarine respectively in the pan of a bread machine. Select a 1 1/2-pound loaf cycle with a light crust and press Start. Add peanut butter chips and semisweet chips when the final knead cycle begins. Cool bread for 10 to 15 minutes before slicing.",
